{"id":804380,"title":"01｜大佬视角解读AI Agent","content":"AI Agent入门实战课程涵盖全景解析与实操搭建两大部分。首先，AI Agent作为智能助手，通过接入大模型如ChatGPT，将改变人机交互方式，简化日常操作流程。例如，用户只需语音指令即可完成点餐等复杂任务。其次，利用字节跳动的Coze平台免费资源，课程指导如何构建个人或企业的AI助理。当前，AI Agent受到广泛关注，多位行业领袖认为其将极大简化应用开发过程，并成为未来数字化转型的关键工具。此外，随着技术进步，AI助理不仅限于软件层面，还将扩展至具备物理执行能力的机器人领域，进一步推动社会生产力提升。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":394556,"user_name":"罗松磊","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1465932,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"9FB653E287732C","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/16/5e/4c/41d9b53c.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1727148237,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100801301,"comment_content":"为什么没有图文呢？快速概览很难很难","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1641662,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/19/0c/be/ee3e52cf.jpg","nickname":"魏龙云","note":"","ucode":"7D6B5D9DA359A8","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":656273,"discussion_content":"你好好沉淀下吧","content_length":7,"likes_number":1,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1737125437,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":403692,"user_name":"阿阳","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1165817,"ip_address":"江苏","ucode":"20A35FB86B1C5C","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/c9/f9/39492855.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1764486594,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100801301,"comment_content":"极客时间上，视频教程太少了，难得的视频教程，学习效率更高。","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":399892,"user_name":"一米阳光","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1301955,